docs {
  Docker only. Expected 200 text/plain UTF-8 attachment careprobe-konsultasi-1.txt with stored Alya Demo record. No filesystem writes or DB mutation. Missing/invalid mode falls back to secure. Normal title 1-40 ASCII letters/digits/hyphen/underscore. Host503; invalid title400; unknown ID404.
}
